    "intro_narrative": "You awaken aboard the 'Aegis', an abandoned deep-space research vessel drifting dangerously near the edge of a supermassive black hole. The ship's central AI has locked down all critical systems due to a massive containment breach in the quantum research labs. Emergency red lights flicker across the metal corridors as the gravity generators hum inconsistently, threatening to fail at any moment. Your only hope of survival and escape is to override the ship's mainframe and initiate the emergency warp jump sequence. However, the override protocols are buried beneath layers of complex navigational data and heavily encrypted archives left behind by the suddenly missing crew. You must navigate through the scattered computer terminals, piece together fragmented data trails, and synthesize the correct access keys before the ship is inevitably pulled past the event horizon. Time is running out, and every calculation counts.",
    "narrative_style": "sci_fi"
  },
